{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"やーい(¨)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は名古屋全握でした"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/05/06/1275412/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"11th最後の全握でした！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"しばらく\nあらロマ見れないのが寂しい( ；∀；)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さて18レーン"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まいちゅん、ゆったん、中田"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"の順で握手！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/05/06/1275412/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まいちゅんはまだ髪型をやってたので\n二人だけで撮っちゃいました(・∀・)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ごめん、まいちゅん！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ゆったんは喉の調子が良くなかったのに\nよく頑張りました！\nお疲れ様"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/05/06/1275412/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"実は中田も2日3日の握手会で\n声をちょっとだけつぶしちゃってたけど\n今日全然喋れて良かった！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来てくださったみなさん\n本当にありがとうございました！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"GW最後の握手会どうでしたか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさんが\nいいGWを過ごせてたらいいなと思います"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/05/06/1275412/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"中田の大好きな\nきしめんも味噌煮込みうどんも\nシロノワールも小倉トーストも\n食べれなかったけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"名古屋にあるケーキ屋さん\n『シェ・シバタ』\nのケーキを食べれました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いろんな種類のケーキがあったけど\n中田はこれにしました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/05/06/1275412/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/05/06/1275412/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"『ブラン ボヌール』\nチーズが2層になってるチーズタルト！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"チーズがしっかりしてるんだけど\n柚子のジャムが味に\nさくさくしたチョコボールが食感に\nそれぞれアクセントを与えてます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うまぺろ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かな￣(=∵=)￣"}],"source":"archive"}